WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:07.620
Conan: Alright, Ladies and Gentlemen, Justice League, let's get Zack Snyder to the stage!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.860
(Audience Cheers and Applause)

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.340
Justice League director, Zack Snyder, thank you for being here again, sir!

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.700
(more cheering)

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.100
Now, uh, yeah, that's the intro

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:25.720
Zack: Does this work?

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.700
Conan: Works better than this one

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:35.460
Uh...Now Zack, I'm told that you have a little bit of a surprise for us, is that right?

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.100
(excited cheers)

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:44.660
Conan: Well, I'm told if you, you know, it;s good to have you here and you wanna bring some people out, is that right?

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.120
Zack: People? I thought you were gonna bring the people out?

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.520
Conan: I will bring 'em out but I thought you were gonna say, "Hey, let's bring people out."

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.640
Zack: Oh, hey! Let's bring some people out!

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.200
Conan: Yeah!!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:53.400
Woo!!

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:59.660
Zack: Now, you guys, I'm sorry, I'm a little delirious but we were literally shooting the movie

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.440
Conan: Backstage?

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.000
They were backstage shooting the movie

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.280
Zack: I was like, CUT! Okay, run now on stage!

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.700
Conan: Let's get 'em out here, Ladies and Gentlemen

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.960
Ben Affleck!

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:09.980
Wooo!!!

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:11.680
Gal Gadot!

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.340
Ray Fisher!

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:17.200
Ezra Miller!

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:22.000
and Jason Momoa!!!

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.180
(Conan laughs)

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.460
Conan: Ladies and Gentlemen, the Justice League!

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:36.200
(more cheering)

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.360
(more laughter)

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.080
Conan:  I love Jason's hat! That is the greatest hat!

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.180
Well, y'know, Jason's touring with the Charlie Daniels band this summer

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:45.760
Zack: No, no!

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:53.880
(more laughter) Zack: Y'know, I mean, it's kind-..... I mean..it looks...it's Justice League

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.960
It's Justice League-esque or -ish

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:02.280
I mean, traditionally, I don't know, the Justice League has an additional character

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:06.840
But... (Conan) Yeah, but we all know that character died

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.700
(Conan) He did, he died. I saw the film

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.400
Zack: Oh, in the movie?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:12.960
Zack and Conan: Yeah

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:15.340
Zack: Well, I mean there was a small...

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:17.340
There was a..

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.860
I mean like, I don;t wanna ruin it or anything but...(cheering)

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:24.140
I mean...

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.700
You gotta have Superman!

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.100
(erupts in cheers)

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.800
Zack: (Please) welcome Henry Cavill !

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:32.880
Conan: No!

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:33.880
Conan: What?

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:38.540
(more cheering and applause)

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:44.760
(Conan chuckles)

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:49.360
Yeah, a'right, gotcha (3x), we're good

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:05.820
Conan: I think you have a little something now that you were, uh, we're all here now

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:10.860
Zack: Let me get this right, you...you think that we would show footage now?

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:11.660
Conan: Now.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.100
Conan: I would think having these people here in person would be enough

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:19.140
Zack: Yeah, it seems like... I mean..(Conan) That's all you need to do is have the people here

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.740
You would not need to show any footage

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:24.580
Zack: I mean, we've only been shooting for like, 2 months?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:33.120
Alright, we shot a small..we kept together..a teeny.. it's really just a taste (audience cheers)

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.420
But, um, yeah so..

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.980
Zack: We should show it? Alright, we should show it!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.860
Conan: Let's give it up for the Justice League!

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.920
Conan: Justice League opens November 17th, 2017

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.760
Thank you all for being here! (Zack) Thanks guys!

